-25/499304131_2192857684863803_6778032229708243833_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MTt_7cKl_1sQ7kNvwF-Sepc&_nc_oc=Adrg-i54iI3b39yHhd7dN3pxj-yd8_skbswVI_HlASlE1WpVUqGCaeMPq7vxf0wQdqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHAoguCUBdp-RnBgX76nZ4jx7dQ7xkETjT6peWCTCalTA&oe=6A7DADFD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The Mighty Mine", "keywords": ["Mining", "Horror", "Exploration", "Multiplayer", "Mighty"], "long_description": "**The Mighty Mine** is a horror exploration-type VR game focused on mining and exploring caves. Follow some simple steps and you can be one of the high rank Minerbots!\n\n# 1. Enter the cave\nEnter the ginormous cave system in search for rare **ores and gems.** Just make sure you\u2019re on your toes, as you might not be as lonely as you think\u2026\n\n# 2. Sell ores\nGrab any ores you can find and head back to the surface. Once your back at camp, dump all the ores you\u2019ve found in the **grinder.** After selling ores you earn **Tokens** and **XP** depending on the rarity and size of the ore.\n\n# 3. Buy upgrades \nAfter earning enough **Tokens**, purchase new cave areas and gear that can help you traverse the mines and earn even more Tokens.\n\n# 4. Rinse and repeat\nKeep upgrading your gear, levelling up and exploring the cave areas that just seem to get crazier and crazier\u2026 Don\u2019t forget to socialise and make friends that can help you while exploring!!", "short_description": "Go down the massive multi-level cave system in search for ores. Find them and sell them to get money. Stay away from anything dangerous that might be lurking in the cave..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/themightymine/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Reckless Workshop", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/themightymine/home", "category": null, "